Speaker 1: This time around, he was born like a proper man.

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:35.780
Speaker 1: For unto us a child is born.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:38.100
Speaker 1: Unto us a son is given.

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:40.100
Speaker 1: The child was born, but the Son was given.

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.460
Speaker 1: He was the eternal Son.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.940
Speaker 1: He one day became a man.

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:53.880
Speaker 1: He says his name shall be called Wonderful Counselor, the Mighty God.

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:55.080
Speaker 1: His name shall be called who?

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:59.240
Speaker 1: The Mighty God and Everlasting Father.

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:03.480
Speaker 1: He had an origin in his humanity, but he's the everlasting Father.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.560
Speaker 1: No beginning and no end.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:06.520
Speaker 1: Say loud Amen.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:07.000
Speaker 1: If you believe.

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:27.550
Speaker 1: Sam.
